the snoc lemmas of `FermatW`, and all of `TGo`. Main result: **`tensorGo_eq`**, the list
pipeline `tensorGo` (nlogn's machine reference) on row-major `listOf` arrays equals the base
fixed-point tensor `tensorMapZ` read on the output box.
