`swp (sgm dS dA) dS dA (idx eX)` (`J6SegILSweep9`) on the descriptor stack `dS` of `AIL6s`.

* the `A` clause: the relabelled run of `AIL6s` and `aLine_math`;
* the `B` clause: `sweep_run` with the invariant "length `∏ t` and `DiscL p`" (`PipeDisc6`),
